_s_binomial_cuda
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Distributions.cpp
--------------------------------

【签名】
    _s_binomial_cuda(count: Tensor[*D, float], prob: Tensor[*D, float], gen: Optional[Generator]) -> Tensor[*D]

【算法】
    gen = get_generator_or_default<CUDAGeneratorImpl>(gen, cuda::detail::getDefaultCUDAGenerator())
    ret = at::empty(count.sizes(), count.options())
    
    iter = at::TensorIteratorConfig()
        .add_output(ret)
        .add_input(count)
        .add_input(prob)
        .build()
    
    launch_binomial_cuda_kernel(iter, gen)
    return ret

【备注】
    - launch_binomial_cuda_kernel: 见 Distributions.cu

