launch_poisson_cuda_kernel
来源: aten/src/ATen/native/cuda/Distributions.cu
--------------------------------

【签名】
    @host→device
    launch_poisson_cuda_kernel(ret: TensorBase, lambda: TensorBase, gen: CUDAGeneratorImpl*)

【算法】
    with gen.mutex_:
        rng_engine_inputs = gen.philox_cuda_state(20)
    
    AT_DISPATCH_FLOATING_TYPES_AND2(Half, BFloat16, ret.scalar_type(), "poisson_cuda", [&] {
        poisson_cuda_kernel<scalar_t>(ret, lambda, rng_engine_inputs)
    })

【备注】
    - philox_cuda_state(20): 预留 20 个随机数序列

